.TH CLIENT 1 "September 2026" "libmyutils" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
client \- test the libmyutils string and file functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B client
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B client
runs checks for four string functions and two file functions, then prints
PASS or FAIL for each check. It creates a temporary file for the file tests.
No command-line arguments are required.
.PP
The installed program uses the shared library
.BR libmyutils.so ,
which must be available to the Linux dynamic loader.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 when all checks pass and a nonzero status if a check or setup fails.
